@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

RECTANGLE "Angular ClientApp" as ClientApp {
  +Browser-based front-end
  +NgRx state management
  +Role-based routing
  +HTTP interceptors
  +Service wrappers
}

RECTANGLE "Backend API" as BackendAPI {
  +.NET Core WebAPI
  +Controllers
  +Domain services
  +Entity Framework/DbContext
}

RECTANGLE "Database" as Database {
  +MS SQL Server
  +Persistent entities
  +Repository scripts
}

RECTANGLE "Authentication" as Auth {
  +SiteMinder
  +Login/session handling
}

RECTANGLE "External Systems" as External {
  +Notification targets
  +PDF generation services
}

ClientApp --> BackendAPI : HTTP requests/responses
BackendAPI --> Database : Data access
ClientApp ..> Auth : Respects authentication
BackendAPI ..> Auth : Enforces authentication
ClientApp --> External : Notification routing
BackendAPI --> External : PDF collection

note right of ClientApp
  Key Components:
  - Role-based routing
  - NgRx store
  - Service wrappers for:
    * Evacuee
    * Incident-task
    * Organization
    * Referral
    * Registration
  - Notification queue
end note

note right of BackendAPI
  Key Components:
  - Domain services
  - Entity Framework
  - DbContext
  - Controllers
end note

note right of Database
  Key Components:
  - MS SQL persistence
  - Repository scripts
  - Controlled-list data
end note

note right of Auth
  Key Components:
  - SiteMinder integration
  - Session management
  - Development backdoor
    (backend-only)
end note

@enduml
